ggml_sycl_apply_xe_kmd_defaults_in: DG2 GPU 0000:03:00.0 (0x56a0) on the xe kernel driver: ggml-sycl set UR_L0_USE_COPY_ENGINE=0 and UR_L0_V2_FORCE_DISABLE_COPY_OFFLOAD=1 so copies stay on the compute queue (blitter copies hang/reset, docs/backend/SYCL.md). GGML_SYCL_XE_COPY_ENGINE_DEFAULT=0 restores the adapter defaults; UR_L0_USE_COPY_ENGINE=1 (v1 adapter) or UR_L0_V2_FORCE_DISABLE_COPY_OFFLOAD=0 (v2) re-enable copy engines and can bring the failure back. --prefetch-experts-slots needs the v1 override and is refused on the v2 adapter regardless.
test-turbo-innerq-runtime: PASS
